    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπετος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ἡ, (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάπετος</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ditch, trench</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχθας καπέτοιο βαθείης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.356
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.564
			</span></i>; <i>hole, grave</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς κοίλην
				κάπετον θέσαν</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				24.797
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1165
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1403
			</span></i> (both anap.); <i>groove</i> for lever, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				72
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				74
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shovel, spade</i> (?), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				4992a
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				ii6
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>).</div>
